$EF92 c L8BossBurst ; Mover A3's end: free four slots from EnemySlots + 171 and start a wave (L8SpawnA) at each one's position
> Witness: L1 2 (l8).
$EFC2 b L8SpawnA ; A wave record (kind $1B) filled with a slot's position and passed to StartWaveAt
$F11A c L8Random ; RandomPtr + 1; A = the ROM byte there
